Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Awe, I'm out of lighter fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much of a hassle to go buy\Nmore, and the gas is shut off right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If I put this one out,\NI can't smoke anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm just going to\Nkeep smoking till the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clean all this up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you done eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Hame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakai-san, Dasai, and Koshin no Kanbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Three sake cups here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three cups,\Nso it's for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, okay, Crum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight out of the bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just go left and\Nturn right at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was one heck of a fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You, uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Order's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kamei, remember when you\Nwet yourself in that last dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.71,0:03:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't wet myself during the last\Ndream What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to turn right somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So where are you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To Aoshima?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, anyway, the sunrise was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just choking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way she went to Inoshima.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where y 'all took that\Npicture, but that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I turn up the AC?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:04:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This humidity's got the air\Nfeeling thicker than gravy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got my hair all frizzed\Nup, and I can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of hair, Aruko,\Nyou should cut yours soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, a Higumadon\Nthat just landed in Omori?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause Higumadon gets puffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought it was funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just waiting for all\Nthe laughter to die down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure know how to crush\Na girl's spirit, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was way puffier when\Nit landed in Amuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for clearing that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you made that joke before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of Higumadon at the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't even funny the first time you\Nsaid it I apologize, oh, big-haired one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be honored to cut said hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,While I do that, can you not\Npoint out how bad my joke was?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cartridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew that was in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the bigger her hair gets, the\Nmore stuff I can store inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Her hair ain't your cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you lost things as much as I\Ndo, you'd store stuff in big hair, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.78,0:06:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid of test\Ndriving it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay with her using your\Nhead like a storage unit, Auro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up for yourself, you knucklehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, did you leave any\Nroom in here for her head?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I'm seeing at least five\Nbeast folk rats violations here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, those are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not always easy to find a place\Nto store some needles, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here you go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, was I just smoking a ghost cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you didn't finish it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A burning cigarette in a run-down\Napartment wasn't on my bingo card today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys smell something burning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Those flames got big real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty dang impressive right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just sitting there burning alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She ain't hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That ghost cigarette must be made of 10\Ncigarettes to get a flame this big going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All that booze she keeps putting\Naway must have seeped into her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One little spark and now\Nshe's a ball of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.10,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Data collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Theory confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell is she not freaking out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang tight just for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? Okay dokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, you fucking kiddies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, bye-bye to all the burnt parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Change smoker cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I haven't really\Nbeen feeling that creative lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is that I get\Nall of these little pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,of different stories constantly\Npopping into my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but then as soon as I think\NI can piece them together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well that's actually\Npretty common, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It happens to you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just never enough\Ntime in the day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your work isn't recognized\Nuntil it's out in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but before I can give form to my ideas,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the endless stream of delusions, my\Nloneliness brings tears into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then before I know it, the day's\Nover and I haven't done anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I check your screen\Ntime real quick? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, let me look at your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's on that for about 60 hours a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're listening to the Aluminium Bat Duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got another hot summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something I'm noticing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I still see people going outside\Nfor a smoke in this heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter how much they sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer till\Nwe get to where Aru is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's about 20 minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you go from Nyagamihara to Inoshima?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but still, smoking is nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, picture this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in bed with a woman, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're out of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.53,0:09:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you dig into\Nsome Japanese barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You visit your parents during Obon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd be happy if you visited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a simple man, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, cool if I smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the ashtray, though. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.34,0:10:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All gorillas have type B blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the other day, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, also, you can go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:10:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing important.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:10:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, folks, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,To say goodbye for the day,\Nthis show was brought to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you by the Yamaplex Beast\NArticles Production Committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you all have a wonderful\Nevening. Bye, guys. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally managed to draw a straight line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry about this, Tataro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your usual assistants weren't\Navailable, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I know. Oh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:12:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I went ahead and reached\Nout to a temp agency
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and found a few experienced\Nassistants for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make sure to meet\Nthat deadline, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hit this huge deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to roll with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone decided to\Nvisit family this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,These new people better be really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, we're here from the\NBeastfolk Temp Agency, Beast Pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Three strangers in my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that most Beast\NFolk are usually easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Excuse me? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see what we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still doing Black\NFill on the first panel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.26,0:12:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been working on it for two hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're filling it in nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing some good work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She gave me a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they don't seem like bad kids to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anybody here who\Ndoesn't smoke or... Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in charge of screen tones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's definitely faster than\Nthe girls doing black fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little messy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been carving out\Nthe middle of the sheet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut clean through the desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to get through\Nthis shitty deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For the background, I wanted\Nto add another window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:14:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. Thank you. It's fine.\NIt's fine. My drawings are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,already weird enough that\NI can get away with this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have to finish the\Nmanuscript if no matter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,what deadlines can't change\NI'm going to get this done
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How many hours has it been since I last\Nslept? My vision is getting blurry and I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,have a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I even trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not even art.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,just making stains on the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The third panel is done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, now you're gonna go have her look at
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it again, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody likes a cheater! Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The buck fells.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's only done two
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,more panels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you have to stop coming\Nto me for every single panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,At least wait until
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you've finished a whole page, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And from now on, while you're all working?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you be a bit quieter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I? What am I even\Ndoing? Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm sorry for the way\Ni treated you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was frustrated because my back was\Nagainst the wall and i took it out on you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll never get angry again please don't\Nleave i can't do this without you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Really great work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for staying extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The temp agency is going to get an\NA rating about you guys from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we get to do this together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only three pages left just the inking then\Ni'm done two hours until the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They say you can only use your\Nabilities cage five times in your life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,for me one of those times\Nis right now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She was such a nice person\Nwasn't she yeah let's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,work on our skills so we can\Nbe more useful next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoking i love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to pick up the manuscript!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you always boiling\Ngrass, Pen-Pen-Neko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't let yourself\Nbe bound by social values.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.94,0:17:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When you abandon it all and choose\Nto live in harmony with nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,only then will you see the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you still have\Na tent and other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I found all of this, so there is no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, kitty cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It claimed this area as its territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it may be small, this\Ncat is more experienced than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling the wind, making\Nthe earth your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's a seeker of life's meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As such, this cat is worthy\Nof the utmost response.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It just bit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, every feeling has a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even pain has something\Nimportant to teach us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.30,0:18:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,all that's some healthy\Nblood flow right there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It is nothing the gentle\Nwind will heal me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no cigarettes means it's\Ntime to go home. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You need no invitation to return
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This really hurts. That gets a tiny\Nsword for teeth. For sure, it's infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You seen a lighter around?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.22,0:18:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lighter is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your turning around muscles broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a weirdo. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When you choose to become one with nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,your tears will...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a half-use cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're staring at a\Nonce-in-a-century downpour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Relentless rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tents of drowning in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go out and catch a frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.46,0:19:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The sweet, seductive scent of\Ncommitting a dangerous act.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your feelings are understandable,\Nbut you must resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyanineko, hunger has always been the driving\Nforce of humanity since its inception.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The hunger grew to material things,\Ncarnal pleasures, power, the list goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All these desires share a common thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They have inspired great\Nconflict in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose to live the\Nway I do because I want
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to prove that we have the\Nability to resist even
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our most tempting yearnings\Nlook when you continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to live a life without\Ndesire nothing will be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,able to shake your resolve\Nmy hope is that you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,also learn to let go of\Nyour attachments there will
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,always be frogs waiting\NI didn't want to catch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,them because I wanted to\Neat them yeah these angry
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,waters are sweeping away\Nanything in its path
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,oh that poor man he craves\Nmaterial things so he
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,subjects himself to this\Nwork huh nyagami river
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,hey that's where you live\Noh a large piece of trash
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,is floating down the river\Ndown and goes now it's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,time for our next segment\Ncancer today back to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the studio holy that's\Nmy tent get away from
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,there it's dangerous Can\NI get some help over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, summer, it's been fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.84,0:23:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.98,0:24:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
